1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
Two matching tiles slide together...

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,920
and merge into one!

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,280
This is Number Merge!

4
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:11,760
Swipe to combine tiles and build bigger numbers!

5
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,200
Four meets four — that's eight!

6
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:19,300
Swipe again, and keep the chain going!

7
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,680
Eight meets eight — that's sixteen!

8
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,960
Bigger tiles, bigger combos!

9
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:32,560
Chain your merges for huge combo bonuses — how high can you climb?

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:40,300
Parents — this builds doubling instinct and strategic planning, one swipe at a time!

11
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:47,880
Find it in the app — tap Math Game Zone, pick Number Merge, choose your level, and play!

12
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:52,400
Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
